notes.diagram:
flowchart TB
  A[Response or error] --> B{HTTP status?}
  B -->|200| C{stop_reason?}
  B -->|429 or 5xx| D[Back off with jitter then retry]
  B -->|400 401 403 404| E[Fix the request or credential]
  C -->|max_tokens or tool_use| F[Raise limit or run the tool]

flowchart TB
  A[New task] --> B{Simple and high volume?}
  B -->|Yes| C[Start on Haiku and benchmark]
  B -->|No| D{Reasoning heavy?}
  D -->|Yes| E[Opus or Fable at higher effort]
  D -->|No| F[Sonnet then tune effort]

flowchart TB
  A[Behavior changed] --> B{Model ID pinned?}
  B -->|No| C[Pin the ID and rerun evals]
  B -->|Yes| D{Config or prompt diff?}
  D -->|Yes| E[Revert the diff and retest]
  D -->|No| F[Check data drift and serving changes]

domains.diagram:
flowchart TB
  A[Agent wants to act] --> B{Hook or gate allows it?}
  B -->|No| C[Blocked with a reason]
  B -->|Yes| D{High risk or low confidence?}
  D -->|Yes| E[Human approval and escalation]
  D -->|No| F[Run and write audit log]
